  "data_abstract": "CERN-LHC. We report measurements of the primary charged particle pseudorapidity\ndensity and transverse momentum distributions in p-Pb collisions at $\\sqrt{s_{NN}}$ = 5.02 TeV,\nand investigate their correlation with experimental observables sensitive to the centrality\nof the collision.\n\nModified 21 MAY 2015 by alice-publications@cern.ch.\nIn fig.16 only the systematic uncertainty for minimum bias was plotted.\nNow, the uncertainty from the centrality selection was added.\n",
